{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Find and grab object. Approach it if visible, scan area if not. Then check object properties, move to final position, and do specific task. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObject    /> <SubTree ID = MoveToObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Sequence>     <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    />     <Action ID = TakeObject    />     <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    />     <SubTree ID = MoveToObject    /> </Sequence> <Sequence>     <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    />     <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> </Sequence> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    />",
